<section class="section intro-section"><p class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</p><div><h2>Big possibilities<br/>begin with people.</h2><p class="large-copy">BeVisioneers Harare Hub is a local chapter of the global beVisioneers fellowship community. We bring together fellows working across climate impact zones to learn from one another and build connections around their ideas.</p><p>Our chapter website puts those people and their work in the spotlight. It helps communities, businesses, and collaborators discover our fellows and find ways to support their growth.</p></div></section>
