<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT BRINGS US TOGETHER</p><h2>Ideas grow<br/>through connection.</h2></div></div><div class="values-grid"><div class="yellow"><span>01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>Make local talent visible.</h3><p>Give fellows a place to share their climate focus, project stories, products, and services as their work develops.</p></div><div class="purple"><span>02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Open the door to possibility.</h3><p>Help people find fellows to collaborate with, buy from, mentor, or support.</p></div><div class="orange"><span>03 / GROW</span><h3>Move forward together.</h3><p>Share events, opportunities, knowledge, and news that help our chapter and its fellows grow.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section global-section"><p class="eyebrow">PART OF SOMETHING BIGGER</p><div><h2>Local roots.<br/>Global community.</h2><p class="large-copy">The global beVisioneers fellowship equips young environmental innovators with training, expert support, and resources to develop their solutions.</p><p>The fellowship is implemented by The DO School Fellowships gGmbH and supported by Mercedes-Benz.</p><a class="button dark" href="https://bevisioneers.world/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore the global fellowship <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
